Package: smsgora
Type: Package
Title: Client for the 'SMS Gora' SMS Gateway
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Joseph", "Niyogushimwa", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "niyogushimwaj967@gmail.com"),
    person("Tekservix", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: Client for the 'SMS Gora' SMS Gateway <https://tekservix.com/smsgora/>,
    which sends and receives text messages (SMS, Short Message Service) through
    your own 'Android' phones and SIM cards. Send single, scheduled and bulk
    messages, check delivery status, read received messages, manage linked phones
    and event notifications, and verify their signatures.
    A 'Tekservix' account with 'SMS Gora' and an API key are required.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://tekservix.com/smsgora/docs/, https://github.com/TekservixHQ/smsgora-r
BugReports: https://github.com/TekservixHQ/smsgora-r/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: httr2 (>= 1.0.0), jsonlite, openssl
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
